<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My First Web Page</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
    <p>This is a simple paragraph showing how text renders on a browser. You can easily make words <strong>bold</strong> or <em>italicized</em> to emphasize your content.</p>

    <h2>Useful Resources</h2>
    <!-- A hyperlink that opens in a new tab -->
    <p>To learn more about web development, check out the <a href="https://www.w3schools.com/html/" target="_blank">W3Schools HTML Tutorial</a>.</p>

</body>
</html>
